{
  "$comment": "Effects codex consolidated from EFFECTS.md and EDM-COMPOSITION.md (the latter removed 2026-10-07; EFFECTS.md covers the same effects, and each recipe here was measured on Live rather than taken on trust). Effect = perceptual cue + mechanism + control law + time scale + energy function. 'build' is a recipe for Ableton Live 12 Standard using device and parameter names read from the real devices; numbers are display units (Hz, dB, ms, %), strings are named options. Automation points use 'at' as a fraction (0..1) of the effect span. Values are starting points, not standards: tune by ear and tempo, and level-match before judging.",
  "version": 1,
  "energy_functions": {
    "accumulate": "Build tension towards an arrival",
    "signal": "Announce that an arrival is imminent",
    "arrive": "Mark the arrival itself",
    "release": "Let energy fall away after an arrival",
    "pulse": "Create forward rhythmic motion",
    "destabilise": "Surprise or disorient",
    "space": "Create depth and ambience",
    "withhold": "Remove energy so what follows lands harder"
  },
